[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the car is fitted with an Air\nBag system, before working on it, it is essential to carry out the\nfollowing preliminary operations: (1) turn the ignition off and\nremove the key; (2) disconnect the battery termnals and insulate\nthem; (3) wait at least 10 minutes before proceeding.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nFULES (\n                                                         <a href=\"#/2753006\">5580C</a>\n                                                          ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753156\">7030B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>1. Remove fixing buttons using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047197.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Fold the rear seat backrest\nover and recline the front seat backrests as far as possible.</p><p>1. Remove the roof lining via the tailgate housing.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the roof\nlining when carrying out this operation.</p></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not bend the roof lining in\nany way.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047198.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the roof lining\nis not damaged.</p><p>Fit the roof lining in place and secure\nit using the special fixing buttons.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753156\">7030B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p>"]]